  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Lapped Surface Plate",
    "overview": "A brushless motor is opened along its shaft on a granite inspection plate. The ground is a cool light grey ruled with a faint 24px grid; every rule is one hairline weight; the only saturated material on the page is copper, and it appears only where current flows. The futuristic note comes from exactness and real-time 3D, never from glow.",
